<p>Once the visual and odometer checks are satisfied, the final step is the execution of the signed condition sign-off. This formal document serves as the legal conclusion of the transport contract. The receiver must carefully review the condition report, which details the agreed-upon status of the vehicle, including any noted pre-existing damages.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">By signing this document, the receiver acknowledges that the motorcycle has been delivered in the condition described, thereby releasing the logistics provider from further liability regarding the vehicle's physical state.</p>
